(3955745, 564394, 76430, '<td valign="top">Live long and prosper.  What''s with the cool glasses.  You need horn rims even if they''ve been taped with electrical tape.  I love the dorky polyester outfit and look.  <a href="//www.comic-con.org/cci/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Comic Con </a> just finished last weekend here in San Diego so I''m surprised you found time to take a picture.  Bring up your problem and this picture in the forums and I think some of our DPC psychologists will be able to help you with your problem.</td>', 'Live long and prosper.  What''s with the cool glasses.  You need horn rims even if they''ve been taped with electrical tape.  I love the dorky polyester outfit and look.  Comic Con  just finished last weekend here in San Diego so I''m surprised you found time to take a picture.  Bring up your problem and this picture in the forums and I think some of our DPC psychologists will be able to help you with your problem.', '2007-08-01 02:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
