(3955786, 564300, 29269, '<td valign="top">This ''black'' could and should have been more black. This is light gray at best (comparing to the shades of gray present on every page, not a monitor issue here). Nice take on the common theme by the way.</td>', 'This ''black'' could and should have been more black. This is light gray at best (comparing to the shades of gray present on every page, not a monitor issue here). Nice take on the common theme by the way.', '2007-08-01 02:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3955789, 563940, 76430, '<td valign="top">The flash shadows are really harsh, but I love the composition and outlandish hair, expression and moves she''s doing.  The hair going out all directions does not look like wind blew off the hat, thus not supporting the title.  Maybe if it was flipped upside-down it would make sense to hold on to your hat.</td>', 'The flash shadows are really harsh, but I love the composition and outlandish hair, expression and moves she''s doing.  The hair going out all directions does not look like wind blew off the hat, thus not supporting the title.  Maybe if it was flipped upside-down it would make sense to hold on to your hat.', '2007-08-01 02:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3955790, 563708, 31637, '<td valign="top">Focus appears off a little</td>', 'Focus appears off a little', '2007-08-01 02:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
