(3955811, 563160, 76430, '<td valign="top">Shelter with electricity, television and stove or furnace.  Doesn''t look as primitive as first glance would indicate.  Nice B/W shot with good texture.</td>', 'Shelter with electricity, television and stove or furnace.  Doesn''t look as primitive as first glance would indicate.  Nice B/W shot with good texture.', '2007-08-01 03:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3955818, 564532, 76430, '<td valign="top">I think it''s cropped a bit too closely.  I can''t tell what''s happening above and why the guy has red fingertips while holding a red heart.  The SALE is cut off.  What is the net?  Were they marked down from 25 cents to 5 cents?  Maybe intermediate mark-downs would be good.</td>', 'I think it''s cropped a bit too closely.  I can''t tell what''s happening above and why the guy has red fingertips while holding a red heart.  The SALE is cut off.  What is the net?  Were they marked down from 25 cents to 5 cents?  Maybe intermediate mark-downs would be good.', '2007-08-01 03:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3955825, 562932, 76430, '<td valign="top">scary!  Great shot.  She really portrays wild emotions.  I''m supposed to go to sleep now after seeing that?</td>', 'scary!  Great shot.  She really portrays wild emotions.  I''m supposed to go to sleep now after seeing that?', '2007-08-01 03:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3956099, 564267, 29269, '<td valign="top">Huh? Other than the unappealing two-tone frame, what else is painted black? Nice door shot by the way. Almost too tight of a crop, too. It seems that the surrounding was nice, too - you could have included more of it in the photo.<br/> <br/>Edit to add:Lyrics... I was slow at the beginning... "I see a red door and I want to paint it black..."<br/>The above comment still stands, should have been more of the door showing,<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Huh? Other than the unappealing two-tone frame, what else is painted black? Nice door shot by the way. Almost too tight of a crop, too. It seems that the surrounding was nice, too - you could have included more of it in the photo. Edit to add:Lyrics... I was slow at the beginning... "I see a red door and I want to paint it black..."The above comment still stands, should have been more of the door showing, Good luck!', '2007-08-01 05:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
