(3956749, 562054, 74078, '<td valign="top">Ribbon!!! Too good. Makes one think it is Dr Achoo or De Sousa. Will have to wait and see. 10 and a pre-empting congratulations</td>', 'Ribbon!!! Too good. Makes one think it is Dr Achoo or De Sousa. Will have to wait and see. 10 and a pre-empting congratulations', '2007-08-01 10:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3956816, 563683, 22922, '<td valign="top">While I like the serenity you captured here, I feel that I don''t have a natural focal point in this image. The soft focus is applied uniformly across the field of view, rather than fading into the distance or foreground. The border also melds with the darker spots on the edges of the photo, making it less crisp. The tones of color you manged to convey are really nice, and there is alot of organic movement, but I''d work a bit more on the composition and aperture selection.</td>', 'While I like the serenity you captured here, I feel that I don''t have a natural focal point in this image. The soft focus is applied uniformly across the field of view, rather than fading into the distance or foreground. The border also melds with the darker spots on the edges of the photo, making it less crisp. The tones of color you manged to convey are really nice, and there is alot of organic movement, but I''d work a bit more on the composition and aperture selection.', '2007-08-01 10:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3956831, 562754, 22922, '<td valign="top">I like the emotion and the natural curve of their bodies. The lighting is very appealing, and they are nicely picked out from the background. On the other hand, too much is in focus in this image, including the tent in the foreground and the blanket to their right. This distracts the eye from the couple, which takes up a small amount of real estate in the image to begin with.</td>', 'I like the emotion and the natural curve of their bodies. The lighting is very appealing, and they are nicely picked out from the background. On the other hand, too much is in focus in this image, including the tent in the foreground and the blanket to their right. This distracts the eye from the couple, which takes up a small amount of real estate in the image to begin with.', '2007-08-01 10:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3956841, 564385, 22922, '<td valign="top">Creative, but too dark. I think this would be a 10 image if the light balance was fixed. Make sure you check the shades of grey/black bar when you submit your image. Parts of the clips disappear into blackness or are distorted by it, distracting the eye from what is otherwise a very poignant and well captured scene. Your focus is nice and sharp, without oversharpness.</td>', 'Creative, but too dark. I think this would be a 10 image if the light balance was fixed. Make sure you check the shades of grey/black bar when you submit your image. Parts of the clips disappear into blackness or are distorted by it, distracting the eye from what is otherwise a very poignant and well captured scene. Your focus is nice and sharp, without oversharpness.', '2007-08-01 10:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3956850, 564412, 22922, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but not the strongest execution. Instead of fog, I get the impression of an old B&amp;W film reel. Too much noise, distracting blur, and no clear direction for the photo take away from the image.</td>', 'Good concept, but not the strongest execution. Instead of fog, I get the impression of an old B&W film reel. Too much noise, distracting blur, and no clear direction for the photo take away from the image.', '2007-08-01 10:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3956859, 564187, 22922, '<td valign="top">Nice but a bit over sharp and conventional. Also a distracting spot next to the sun looks like lens dust, maybe a bird?</td>', 'Nice but a bit over sharp and conventional. Also a distracting spot next to the sun looks like lens dust, maybe a bird?', '2007-08-01 10:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3956863, 562054, 22922, '<td valign="top">Can''t really see the snake''s head (yes I can see all the shades of black in the bar). Otherwise a fantastic shot.</td>', 'Can''t really see the snake''s head (yes I can see all the shades of black in the bar). Otherwise a fantastic shot.', '2007-08-01 10:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3956867, 564081, 22922, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to look at, what is this picture of? I''m assuming you used infrared/night vision for the photo, but I am not getting anything out of the image.</td>', 'I don''t know what to look at, what is this picture of? I''m assuming you used infrared/night vision for the photo, but I am not getting anything out of the image.', '2007-08-01 11:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
