(3958382, 562054, 80887, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t get much better than this. Not only is the maker''s interpretation of the theme spot on, but the image can easily stand on its own, beyond this challenge. Everything in this image works to convey the title -- the color of the glass and liquid, the snake, the angle, the disembodied floating, the unspilled liquid, and the reflection that hints at an unseen netherworld beyond the black. Love it!</td>', 'It doesn''t get much better than this. Not only is the maker''s interpretation of the theme spot on, but the image can easily stand on its own, beyond this challenge. Everything in this image works to convey the title -- the color of the glass and liquid, the snake, the angle, the disembodied floating, the unspilled liquid, and the reflection that hints at an unseen netherworld beyond the black. Love it!', '2007-08-01 17:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
