(3959506, 562178, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like the honesty of this shot but I think there is just too much with the cuff and button on her shorts, the shoes, the chair she''s sitting on.  Does that make sense?  I''d crop it so that we are concentrating on her upper body and that way we wouldn''t get distracted by all of the other things going on in the shot. She'' lovely and her eyes are well captured. Hope this is helpful. Just my take on it. ;~D</td>', 'I really like the honesty of this shot but I think there is just too much with the cuff and button on her shorts, the shoes, the chair she''s sitting on.  Does that make sense?  I''d crop it so that we are concentrating on her upper body and that way we wouldn''t get distracted by all of the other things going on in the shot. She'' lovely and her eyes are well captured. Hope this is helpful. Just my take on it. ;~D', '2007-08-01 22:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
