(3959643, 563631, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  A watch without hands on an LP record.  It works well in B/W.  Seeing the center label of the actual LP record this song was on, or better yet, the OOT 45 single, sitting on an old phonograph would have been wonderful.  It''s not as sharp as it could be, but about as good as I could have done.</td>', 'Very creative.  A watch without hands on an LP record.  It works well in B/W.  Seeing the center label of the actual LP record this song was on, or better yet, the OOT 45 single, sitting on an old phonograph would have been wonderful.  It''s not as sharp as it could be, but about as good as I could have done.', '2007-08-01 23:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959646, 563986, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beautiful animal. Doors are a little overexposed.</td>', 'Beautiful animal. Doors are a little overexposed.', '2007-08-01 23:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959648, 564151, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  - man the detail is amazing.  That''s some kind of macro.</td>', 'ROFL  - man the detail is amazing.  That''s some kind of macro.', '2007-08-01 23:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959649, 563785, 37930, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice macro. I wish it''s eyeball was in focus, though. That would have been really cool. The lighting on top of the bug is kinda harsh too, which detracts from the overall quality of the photo. Even so, I like it alot.</td>', 'Wow, nice macro. I wish it''s eyeball was in focus, though. That would have been really cool. The lighting on top of the bug is kinda harsh too, which detracts from the overall quality of the photo. Even so, I like it alot.', '2007-08-01 23:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959652, 563556, 33672, '<td valign="top">Funny title and a nice capture.</td>', 'Funny title and a nice capture.', '2007-08-01 23:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959655, 564409, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and framing. Focus seems a bit soft.</td>', 'Nice comp and framing. Focus seems a bit soft.', '2007-08-01 23:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959658, 564577, 37930, '<td valign="top">Too funny, lol. 10 just for being some quality comedic relief in this challenge. Photo is very aesthetically pleasing, as well. Lots to look at, and nothing about it is hard to look at.</td>', 'Too funny, lol. 10 just for being some quality comedic relief in this challenge. Photo is very aesthetically pleasing, as well. Lots to look at, and nothing about it is hard to look at.', '2007-08-01 23:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
