(3959668, 562622, 23002, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if anyone would use this song...and since you had the guts to do it I will give you an extra point...giving you a 7.</td>', 'I was wondering if anyone would use this song...and since you had the guts to do it I will give you an extra point...giving you a 7.', '2007-08-01 23:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959669, 564626, 37930, '<td valign="top">Lighting is kinda harsh, I would have tried a softer light. Also, it''s just not attention-grabbing--there isn''t much of interest here.</td>', 'Lighting is kinda harsh, I would have tried a softer light. Also, it''s just not attention-grabbing--there isn''t much of interest here.', '2007-08-01 23:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959670, 563300, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sh*t~ that is one fine photo.  Every photo I look at I can hear the song in my head, but this not only does that for me but makes me want to linger awhile and just study the beauty of that crimson sky.  Man oh man - this might be my pick for the challenge.</td>', 'Sh*t~ that is one fine photo.  Every photo I look at I can hear the song in my head, but this not only does that for me but makes me want to linger awhile and just study the beauty of that crimson sky.  Man oh man - this might be my pick for the challenge.', '2007-08-01 23:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959671, 564382, 33672, '<td valign="top">Perfect example of theme. Grain works well with this.</td>', 'Perfect example of theme. Grain works well with this.', '2007-08-01 23:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959674, 564292, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent cloud picture!  CPF?  The blue doesn''t so much turn to grey as having blue sky and some grey in the clouds.</td>', 'Excellent cloud picture!  CPF?  The blue doesn''t so much turn to grey as having blue sky and some grey in the clouds.', '2007-08-01 23:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959676, 561276, 33672, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite songs by the stones. Nice comp and shadows.</td>', 'One of my favorite songs by the stones. Nice comp and shadows.', '2007-08-01 23:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959680, 563970, 33672, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites by the Stones. Great wide angle shot.</td>', 'One of my favorites by the Stones. Great wide angle shot.', '2007-08-01 23:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959682, 564554, 15711, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I''m crazy about the bark on the tree yet it does add a bit of texture and pattern.  The neutral duotone helps in that regard, as it makes us look more at the pattern than anything else. I kinda like this image. The more I write, the more it grows on me.  I like that the whites of his eyes are prominent.</td>', 'Not sure if I''m crazy about the bark on the tree yet it does add a bit of texture and pattern.  The neutral duotone helps in that regard, as it makes us look more at the pattern than anything else. I kinda like this image. The more I write, the more it grows on me.  I like that the whites of his eyes are prominent.', '2007-08-01 23:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959683, 560905, 76430, '<td valign="top">This has got to be the most popular title, and for DPC probably expected.  It''s mostly dead stalks, but you do have an ailing flower there.</td>', 'This has got to be the most popular title, and for DPC probably expected.  It''s mostly dead stalks, but you do have an ailing flower there.', '2007-08-01 23:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959684, 564439, 15711, '<td valign="top">GREAT take on the song.  Nice blur action.  I like it a lot.</td>', 'GREAT take on the song.  Nice blur action.  I like it a lot.', '2007-08-01 23:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
