(3959694, 563673, 37930, '<td valign="top">lol, poor couple. I hope they don''t know about the photo being used in this context. (at least not the woman, the man probably already knows after a week)</td>', 'lol, poor couple. I hope they don''t know about the photo being used in this context. (at least not the woman, the man probably already knows after a week)', '2007-08-01 23:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
