(3963971, 563599, 64670, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the childs name is Suzie?  Not sure from the photo obviously.<br/> <br/>As far as images go for me, I like to understand the story by viewing the image.  For me as I see this, I can''t really understand what you''re trying to portray.  If it''s a portrait, then the location seems a bit off - the child doesn''t appear to be overly thrilled with where she is at.<br/> <br/>It appears as though there may be a person to your left hand side that the child is trying to get to - if you were using that person to get the child''s attention, may I suggest you get them behind you around shoulder level so that the child''s eyes are facing the camera more.</td>', 'Perhaps the childs name is Suzie?  Not sure from the photo obviously. As far as images go for me, I like to understand the story by viewing the image.  For me as I see this, I can''t really understand what you''re trying to portray.  If it''s a portrait, then the location seems a bit off - the child doesn''t appear to be overly thrilled with where she is at. It appears as though there may be a person to your left hand side that the child is trying to get to - if you were using that person to get the child''s attention, may I suggest you get them behind you around shoulder level so that the child''s eyes are facing the camera more.', '2007-08-03 01:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
