(3979033, 563158, 23002, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I finally made it to ribbon territory!  It feels good. :)<br/> <br/>thanks for everyone''s kind words and nice votes.  And looking at the 1st and 2nd place finishers.... I do not mind being behind those ones at all.  they deserve the first and second place ribbons.</td>', 'Wow.  I finally made it to ribbon territory!  It feels good. :) thanks for everyone''s kind words and nice votes.  And looking at the 1st and 2nd place finishers.... I do not mind being behind those ones at all.  they deserve the first and second place ribbons.', '2007-08-08 01:06:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979036, 563158, 71657, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by basssman7:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow.  I finally made it to ribbon territory!  It feels good. :)<br/> <br/>thanks for everyone''s kind words and nice votes.  And looking at the 1st and 2nd place finishers.... I do not mind being behind those ones at all.  they deserve the first and second place ribbons. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Congrats.  Nice pic.</td>', 'Originally posted by basssman7: Wow.  I finally made it to ribbon territory!  It feels good. :) thanks for everyone''s kind words and nice votes.  And looking at the 1st and 2nd place finishers.... I do not mind being behind those ones at all.  they deserve the first and second place ribbons.  Congrats.  Nice pic.', '2007-08-08 01:07:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979037, 563631, 70128, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments. Now, I would greatly appreciate if those rating with 1''s, 2''s and 3''s would leave a message, explaining what is so wrong with this (and other) pictures. We are all here to learn, and we all learn from mistakes. So if you think a picture is real bad, please explain what should be improved. Thank you!</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments. Now, I would greatly appreciate if those rating with 1''s, 2''s and 3''s would leave a message, explaining what is so wrong with this (and other) pictures. We are all here to learn, and we all learn from mistakes. So if you think a picture is real bad, please explain what should be improved. Thank you!', '2007-08-08 01:07:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979049, 562399, 12253, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! Great final processing on image, fantastic score and placement!</td>', 'Congratulations! Great final processing on image, fantastic score and placement!', '2007-08-08 01:09:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979067, 563970, 76430, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Bragi on the blue ribbon!  Another great Iceland scene.  I didn''t get to this one before now, but it definitely deserves a ribbon.</td>', 'Congratulations Bragi on the blue ribbon!  Another great Iceland scene.  I didn''t get to this one before now, but it definitely deserves a ribbon.', '2007-08-08 01:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979081, 563300, 23002, '<td valign="top">Wow, great pic!  Congrats on your ribbon. :)<br/> <br/>edit to add:  thanks for the comment on my pic.  I will gladly show you action shots if you show me how to take incredible landscapes like this. ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-08 00:41:58.</i></td>', 'Wow, great pic!  Congrats on your ribbon. :) edit to add:  thanks for the comment on my pic.  I will gladly show you action shots if you show me how to take incredible landscapes like this. ;)', '2007-08-08 01:12:05.000000', '2007-08-08 01:41:58.000000', 0),
