(3979124, 562122, 81362, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, and even more appreciated finally getting to see the notes about how you got it. Can''t understand why the average rating wasn''t higher - I put it easily in the the top 10 for sharpness, composition, and fitting the theme.</td>', 'Excellent shot, and even more appreciated finally getting to see the notes about how you got it. Can''t understand why the average rating wasn''t higher - I put it easily in the the top 10 for sharpness, composition, and fitting the theme.', '2007-08-08 01:16:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979141, 563158, 23002, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JohnLampkin:</b></div><hr/><i> This would be a 10 if it matched the lyric, which it doesn''t. Does anybody actually pay attention?<br/>Great action shot!! 7 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hmmm.  actually it was released as a single on June 1 1968 in the USA and was #1 on the charts for 11 weeks. :)  (although it was not on an album until 1969 "Through the Past, Darkly" <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by JohnLampkin: This would be a 10 if it matched the lyric, which it doesn''t. Does anybody actually pay attention?Great action shot!! 7   Hmmm.  actually it was released as a single on June 1 1968 in the USA and was #1 on the charts for 11 weeks. :)  (although it was not on an album until 1969 "Through the Past, Darkly" ', '2007-08-08 01:20:08.000000', NULL, 0),
