(3979237, 563158, 72670, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I wish I was able to snap clear action shots like this one. I just said to my wife,just before voting was over that this one would win. I am surprised that it didn''t. Congrats fellow first ribbon winner!!</td>', 'Great capture. I wish I was able to snap clear action shots like this one. I just said to my wife,just before voting was over that this one would win. I am surprised that it didn''t. Congrats fellow first ribbon winner!!', '2007-08-08 01:35:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979238, 563338, 77316, '<td valign="top">Nice guess, phlick!</td>', 'Nice guess, phlick!', '2007-08-08 01:35:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979274, 563970, 72670, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Congrats on your first place showing. My wife and I have this ongoing hatred/envy for all of you in Iceland. You seem to hog all the ribbons and well deserved. It is quite often that we see outstanding photography from the Iceland crew. Keep up the beautiful work!</td>', 'Great shot. Congrats on your first place showing. My wife and I have this ongoing hatred/envy for all of you in Iceland. You seem to hog all the ribbons and well deserved. It is quite often that we see outstanding photography from the Iceland crew. Keep up the beautiful work!', '2007-08-08 01:41:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979282, 564310, 67697, '<td valign="top">Can''t really say I like the black lol.  You did do a nice job of getting the hand in focus.  Maybe next time just dip the brush in a big glob of black paint and have the paint drip from the brush.  Might be easier?</td>', 'Can''t really say I like the black lol.  You did do a nice job of getting the hand in focus.  Maybe next time just dip the brush in a big glob of black paint and have the paint drip from the brush.  Might be easier?', '2007-08-08 01:42:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979284, 563970, 52549, '<td valign="top">Another beauty. Great work, Brin, congrats on the blue.</td>', 'Another beauty. Great work, Brin, congrats on the blue.', '2007-08-08 01:42:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979287, 563247, 71657, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for your votes.  I have finally accomplished one of my goals, and that was to make it into the top 25.  After 8 challenges, I finally made it,.  I now will become a member, as I promised myself I would as soon as I accomplished my first goal.  Next is to break into the top 5.  Thanks to all, and congrats to the winners.  Ya''ll were in my top picks!!!</td>', 'Thanks to all for your votes.  I have finally accomplished one of my goals, and that was to make it into the top 25.  After 8 challenges, I finally made it,.  I now will become a member, as I promised myself I would as soon as I accomplished my first goal.  Next is to break into the top 5.  Thanks to all, and congrats to the winners.  Ya''ll were in my top picks!!!', '2007-08-08 01:43:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979288, 563300, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, smooth as silk. Big congrats on the red, Leo.</td>', 'Beautiful, smooth as silk. Big congrats on the red, Leo.', '2007-08-08 01:43:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979295, 562274, 39471, '<td valign="top">After challenge.. I did a little better than I thought I would. I noticed I posted the wrong lens, I used the tamron 28-75 2.8 and not the 70-200L. Oh well.</td>', 'After challenge.. I did a little better than I thought I would. I noticed I posted the wrong lens, I used the tamron 28-75 2.8 and not the 70-200L. Oh well.', '2007-08-08 01:45:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979299, 563158, 52549, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon! Great shot.</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon! Great shot.', '2007-08-08 01:45:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979313, 564287, 56880, '<td valign="top">I like the red tones.  The wisp in the upper right looks like a scratch on an otherwise unblemished surface.</td>', 'I like the red tones.  The wisp in the upper right looks like a scratch on an otherwise unblemished surface.', '2007-08-08 01:47:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979335, 562912, 75386, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by amievil:</b></div><hr/><i> "paint" it black </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Rockers dont care about no spelling! <br/>Great car and choice of background</td>', 'Originally posted by amievil: "paint" it black   Rockers dont care about no spelling! Great car and choice of background', '2007-08-08 01:51:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979336, 564434, 42013, '<td valign="top">Something about the centered comp with the one stretched out leg throw it off for me. Also something about the angle of the photo doesn''t draw the viewer in, just makes him more of a voyer in the scene-disconnected if that makes sense. (probably doesn''t ;)) <br/> <br/>The neutral BG doesn''t do anything to enhance the texture or color of the spider. The fly shows up but only after really studying it and I suspect most voters skipped right past the fly.<br/> <br/>There really isn''t anything horrible about the photo, just nothing that really grabs me and makes me sit up in my chair! <br/> <br/>This is just my fly by opinion...maybe it sheds a little light on the voters reaction. :)</td>', 'Something about the centered comp with the one stretched out leg throw it off for me. Also something about the angle of the photo doesn''t draw the viewer in, just makes him more of a voyer in the scene-disconnected if that makes sense. (probably doesn''t ;))  The neutral BG doesn''t do anything to enhance the texture or color of the spider. The fly shows up but only after really studying it and I suspect most voters skipped right past the fly. There really isn''t anything horrible about the photo, just nothing that really grabs me and makes me sit up in my chair!  This is just my fly by opinion...maybe it sheds a little light on the voters reaction. :)', '2007-08-08 01:51:54.000000', NULL, 0);
