(3979344, 563970, 44453, '<td valign="top">wow you really are giving that 16-35mm lens a workout.  congratulations!</td>', 'wow you really are giving that 16-35mm lens a workout.  congratulations!', '2007-08-08 01:52:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979354, 563300, 78114, '<td valign="top">congrats on your first of many ribbons! great pic there!</td>', 'congrats on your first of many ribbons! great pic there!', '2007-08-08 01:55:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979364, 563158, 62727, '<td valign="top">WOW!  What a fabulous shot!  Congrats!</td>', 'WOW!  What a fabulous shot!  Congrats!', '2007-08-08 01:58:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979365, 564434, 44453, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit of an issue with jpeg compression - the background has strange blobs of colour.<br/> <br/>And really it looks like the spider is dead, just hanging from one leg...</td>', 'There''s a bit of an issue with jpeg compression - the background has strange blobs of colour. And really it looks like the spider is dead, just hanging from one leg...', '2007-08-08 01:58:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979376, 564080, 76430, '<td valign="top">You did all you could with that original picture, other than Neat Image as I had suggested, but why submit this picture at all?  Surely you could have picked about any other picture and found a title or lyric that would shoehorn it in like some (understatement!) others did.</td>', 'You did all you could with that original picture, other than Neat Image as I had suggested, but why submit this picture at all?  Surely you could have picked about any other picture and found a title or lyric that would shoehorn it in like some (understatement!) others did.', '2007-08-08 02:01:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979380, 564434, 78114, '<td valign="top">the composition just seems odd to me. (the outtake has better composition.) there is nothing drawing me into this picture. the BG is flat in color and texture, no DOF. the subject matter is interesting, but not the greatest angle to capture a story- its hard to tell whats going on unless you really study it... and with 600+ entries you gotta grab interest quickly. don''t give up! (i won''t either!)</td>', 'the composition just seems odd to me. (the outtake has better composition.) there is nothing drawing me into this picture. the BG is flat in color and texture, no DOF. the subject matter is interesting, but not the greatest angle to capture a story- its hard to tell whats going on unless you really study it... and with 600+ entries you gotta grab interest quickly. don''t give up! (i won''t either!)', '2007-08-08 02:02:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979392, 563300, 64994, '<td valign="top">Very nice!! Great shot!!!</td>', 'Very nice!! Great shot!!!', '2007-08-08 02:04:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979397, 563970, 64994, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!</td>', 'Awesome!!', '2007-08-08 02:05:48.000000', NULL, 0),
