(3979689, 562608, 48471, '<td valign="top">Where''s the other pair of shoes? Seen a lot of people sleeping in the streets these days, but this one is special, unique, beautiful. The resonance, rhythm, curves, a bold look at one body, a hidden one behind, hands, shoes, straight lines in the bottom half, fractals on the top half, sleeping beauty, whatever... I almost feel guilty for looking at the photo, and I don''t want to even try thinking how would I feel being there and trying to take this photo. So intimate!</td>', 'Where''s the other pair of shoes? Seen a lot of people sleeping in the streets these days, but this one is special, unique, beautiful. The resonance, rhythm, curves, a bold look at one body, a hidden one behind, hands, shoes, straight lines in the bottom half, fractals on the top half, sleeping beauty, whatever... I almost feel guilty for looking at the photo, and I don''t want to even try thinking how would I feel being there and trying to take this photo. So intimate!', '2007-08-08 04:21:12.000000', NULL, 0),
