(3980379, 564291, 37276, '<td valign="top">Great shot - outside of DP, the client would be thrilled with a shot like this. The comment of the dress "being blown out" - He seems to be a sport/landscape photographer so take that comment for what it''s worth. I hate when people get on here and just tear up others in critique and don''t offer anything worth value. You did a wonderful job - keep it up!</td>', 'Great shot - outside of DP, the client would be thrilled with a shot like this. The comment of the dress "being blown out" - He seems to be a sport/landscape photographer so take that comment for what it''s worth. I hate when people get on here and just tear up others in critique and don''t offer anything worth value. You did a wonderful job - keep it up!', '2007-08-08 10:36:05.000000', NULL, 0),
