(3983662, 564382, 62187, '<td valign="top">I gave out 15 ''10''s'' for the ''Rolling Stones'' challenge, this was one of the photos. This photo, imho, was highly underated. Do the voters know the words to the song? I think not. Check it out...<br/> <br/>''I met a gin soaked, bar-room queen in Memphis,<br/>She tried to take me upstairs for a ride.<br/>She had to heave me right across her shoulder<br/>cause I just cant seem to drink you off my mind''<br/> <br/>The photo is excellent. What a great capture for the song! Bad voters!</td>', 'I gave out 15 ''10''s'' for the ''Rolling Stones'' challenge, this was one of the photos. This photo, imho, was highly underated. Do the voters know the words to the song? I think not. Check it out... ''I met a gin soaked, bar-room queen in Memphis,She tried to take me upstairs for a ride.She had to heave me right across her shouldercause I just cant seem to drink you off my mind'' The photo is excellent. What a great capture for the song! Bad voters!', '2007-08-09 10:53:47.000000', NULL, 0),
