(3991948, 564412, 41337, '<td valign="top">Looks like a cd album cover waiting to happen. A very inviting image.</td>', 'Looks like a cd album cover waiting to happen. A very inviting image.', '2007-08-13 01:54:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3992176, 564431, 47316, '<td valign="top">this is really cool. I dunno... it seems like such a cool scene that the photo fell short for me. You really have to look at it to find the interest. And I don''t mean I''d like to see the DPC no thought required type photo, just that I wish you had showcased the person and water more and left out all that you have in the foreground, it doesn''t do the scene justice. Also seems a little flat on the contrast and tones. Some burning around the edges might have helped if this had been advanced editing.<br/> <br/>A shot at an angle down the line of the water might have been cool for this.</td>', 'this is really cool. I dunno... it seems like such a cool scene that the photo fell short for me. You really have to look at it to find the interest. And I don''t mean I''d like to see the DPC no thought required type photo, just that I wish you had showcased the person and water more and left out all that you have in the foreground, it doesn''t do the scene justice. Also seems a little flat on the contrast and tones. Some burning around the edges might have helped if this had been advanced editing. A shot at an angle down the line of the water might have been cool for this.', '2007-08-13 02:56:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3992288, 561758, 78021, '<td valign="top">I agree with the comments, the color and focus could have been better.<br/> <br/>This submission was rushed, and the results show it.  Hopefuly this is my lowest score ever. (not meaning I am happy with the low score, but that I aim to only submit photos of much higher quality than this in the future)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-15 01:47:51.</i></td>', 'I agree with the comments, the color and focus could have been better. This submission was rushed, and the results show it.  Hopefuly this is my lowest score ever. (not meaning I am happy with the low score, but that I aim to only submit photos of much higher quality than this in the future)', '2007-08-13 03:47:38.000000', '2007-08-15 02:47:51.000000', 0),
(3994169, 562975, 67697, '<td valign="top">This only got one comment?  Well you know now that I have to add one.  You have a way of finding the most interestingly dressed people in Japan lol.  I will say that I do not know the song so the title combined with the pic does not really make sense to me.  But I do love how your angle makes it look likd they are both staring up at the billboard.  I like the perspective because it makes this more of a unique photo.</td>', 'This only got one comment?  Well you know now that I have to add one.  You have a way of finding the most interestingly dressed people in Japan lol.  I will say that I do not know the song so the title combined with the pic does not really make sense to me.  But I do love how your angle makes it look likd they are both staring up at the billboard.  I like the perspective because it makes this more of a unique photo.', '2007-08-13 15:03:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3996487, 564412, 35545, '<td valign="top">I''m not familiar with the song, but that selective focus is really cool.</td>', 'I''m not familiar with the song, but that selective focus is really cool.', '2007-08-14 10:17:23.000000', NULL, 0),
